[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":87},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":-5,"_57":37,"_58":59},"expiresAt",1795221633000,"id","g0z2h9egt3off5o39j4avh9cu","title","Siemens 28 个工业软件产品受 Google Brotli 缓冲区溢出漏洞影响","originalTitle","Siemens Industrial Software Products","summary","Google Brotli 1.0.3 至 1.2.0 的解码器 c/dec/decode.c 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可利用特制 Brotli 压缩流破坏内存、泄露敏感内容、导致拒绝服务，或可能执行任意代码。","reason","公告列明 28 个受影响 Siemens 产品、CVSS v3.1 9.8 评分及可用的临时缓解措施，便于资产所有者判断处置需求。","source",{"_64":86},"links",{"_77":85},"publishedAt","2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-17T16:20:31.846Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[81,82,83,84,45],"score",81,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","CISA","body",{"_59":76,"_77":-5,"_78":79,"_80":37},"outline",[70],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[60,61,62],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_63":68,"_64":69},{"_63":66,"_64":67},{"_63":31,"_64":65},"slug","name","漏洞披露","industrial","工业控制","google","Google / 谷歌",{"_11":71,"_72":73,"_74":75},"sec-1","text","28 个受影响的产品","level",4,"<p>Google Brotli 1.0.3 至 1.2.0 版本在所有平台上的 Brotli 解码器（c/dec/decode.c）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未经验证的攻击者可通过精心构造的 Brotli 压缩流破坏相邻解码器状态的内存、泄露敏感内存内容、导致拒绝服务，或可能执行任意代码。用户需要将 1.0.3 至 1.2.0 之间的任何 Brotli 库或二进制文件更新至最新可用版本：1.0.10、1.1.1 或 1.2.1。</p><h4 id=\"sec-1\"><strong>28 个受影响的产品</strong></h4><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Execution Core</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Execution Discrete</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Execution Foundation</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Execution Pharma</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Execution Process</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Intelligence</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Intra Plant Logistics</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Quality</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter RDnL</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上进行缓解。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter X</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上缓解此漏洞。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>PADS Pro Essentials</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙处阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>PADS Pro Student Edition</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙处阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>PADS Professional</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙处阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>PAVE360 Automotive 2026</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Process Preparation X</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>可在 IIS Reverse Proxy 上缓解此漏洞。请参阅 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Simcenter Executable Digital Twin</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Simcenter Studio</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Teamcenter V2412</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>有关 Teamcenter 手动缓解说明，请参阅此处：https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869204</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Teamcenter V2506</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>有关 Teamcenter 手动缓解说明，请参阅此处：https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869204</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Teamcenter V2512</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>有关 Teamcenter 手动缓解说明，请参阅此处：https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869204</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Teamcenter V2606</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>有关 Teamcenter 手动缓解说明，请参阅此处：https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869204</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Xpedition Designer</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>修复措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙处阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无可用修复</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复程序</p><hr><h5><strong>Xpedition Enterprise</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙上阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>HyperLynx</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>禁用 brotli 压缩，并在网络防火墙上阻止 brotli 压缩。</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>Innexis Architecture Native Acceleration 2026</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>Insights Hub</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Connect Electronics</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS 反向代理上缓解。请参见 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>Opcenter Connect MOM</strong></h5><p>产品状态：known_affected</p><h5><strong>补救措施</strong></h5><p><strong>缓解措施</strong><br>该漏洞可在 IIS 反向代理上缓解。请参见 https://support.sw.siemens.com/en-US/knowledge-base/PL8869211</p><p><strong>暂无</strong><br>目前没有可用的修复方案</p><hr><h5><strong>附加指标</strong></h5><p><strong>相关 CWE：</strong> <a href=\"https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/787.html\">CWE-787 越界写入</a></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>CVSS 版本</strong></th>\n<th><strong>基础评分</strong></th>\n<th><strong>基础严重性</strong></th>\n<th><strong>向量字符串</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3.1</td>\n<td>9.8</td>\n<td><strong>严重</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.first.org/cvss/calculator/3.1#CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\">CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-111497\">查看 CVE 详情</a></p>","original","zhKind","translation","complete","漏洞","补丁","工控","Google","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-321-04","CISA 安全公告",{"_88":89,"_90":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
